        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Editorial Still from a Line\n\nTurns one line of subject text into an editorial photograph. A Template node holds the house look, so the caller only supplies the subject.\n\n**How it works:** \"Subject\" feeds \"Prompt\", which wraps it in fixed directions for natural light, shallow depth of field and no text or logos. \"Render\" generates a 16:9 image from that prompt, with a negative prompt against watermarks, and \"Image\" shows it. Pick a model on \"Render\" before running.\n\n**Try this:** Replace the \"Subject\" text with your own scene, or edit the style sentence in \"Prompt\" to change the look of every image this workflow makes."
        },
